## Acknowledgments

This project builds on the work of two upstream open-source projects:

- **Mindcraft** (mindcraft-bots/mindcraft) — LLM bot reference for tasks, profiles, and modes
- **Azalea** (azalea-rs/azalea) — Rust Minecraft client protocol library

The project is developed with substantial AI-assisted engineering
("vibe coding") as a personal experiment.

